</figure>
<fieldset style="margin:0;padding:0;border:0;min-width:0">
<legend style="font-weight:800;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px">Choose evidence to cite</legend>
<label class="dinolab-evidence-citation" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:12px 8px;border-top:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6">
<input type="checkbox" data-bench-citation="fossil" style="margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0"/>
<span>
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:4px">A · Fossil observation</strong>Researchers reported quill knobs on a Velociraptor forearm bone.</span>
</label>
<label class="dinolab-evidence-citation" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:12px 8px;border-top:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6">
<input type="checkbox" data-bench-citation="comparison" style="margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0"/>
<span>
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:4px">B · Living comparison</strong>In living birds, these knobs anchor large feathers through ligaments.</span>
</label>
</fieldset>
<a href="https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145076" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);line-height:1.6;text-decoration:underline">Read the research: Turner, Makovicky &amp; Norell (2007)</a>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">The paper supplies the observations. The statements and drawings here are teaching materials.</p>
</aside>
<section class="dinolab-evidence-task" aria-labelledby="dino-bench-task" style="padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:12px;background:var(--allo-stem-panel, #1e293b);min-width:0">
<h3 id="dino-bench-task" tabindex="-1" style="font-size:19px;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.4">What does each statement do?</h3>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">Read the case file, then distinguish a description from an explanation and a claim that reaches too far. You can revise your choices after feedback.</p>
<dl class="dinolab-evidence-key" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:8px;margin:0 0 16px">
<div style="padding:10px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;font-size:12px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" height="21" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M2 12Q12 0 22 12Q12 24 2 12ZM15 12A3 3 0 1 1 9 12A3 3 0 1 1 15 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
</path>
</svg>Observation</dt>
<dd style="margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5">A feature reported in the fossil.</dd>
</div>
<div style="padding:10px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;font-size:12px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" height="21" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M9 15L15 9M9 8L12 5A5 5 0 0 1 19 12L16 15M8 9L5 12A5 5 0 0 0 12 19L15 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
</path>
</svg>Supported inference</dt>
<dd style="margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5">An explanation connected to evidence.</dd>
</div>
<div style="padding:10px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;font-size:12px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" height="21" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M4 8V4H8M16 4H20V8M20 16V20H16M8 20H4V16M8 12H16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
</path>
</svg>Overreach</dt>
<dd style="margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5">A claim that goes beyond this evidence.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<div class="dinolab-evidence-statement" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155)">
<label for="dino-bench-sort-marks" style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:7px">1. The fossil forearm has quill knobs.</label>
<select id="dino-bench-sort-marks" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
<option value="" selected="">Choose a statement type</option>
<option value="observation">Observation</option>
<option value="inference">Supported inference</option>
<option value="overreach">Overreach</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="dinolab-evidence-statement" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155)">
<label for="dino-bench-sort-flight" style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:7px">2. Those knobs prove that Velociraptor could fly.</label>
<select id="dino-bench-sort-flight" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
