</div>
</nav>
<div id="dinopanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="dinotab-dig" style="padding:16px">
<div>
<div style="margin-bottom:12px">
<div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800">⛏️ Excavate and compare evidence</div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);margin-top:2px">Uncover clues, compare six candidates, and decide whether the evidence is enough.</div>
</div>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px">This is a catalog mystery. Grid fragments are symbolic, and unlocked clues come from the catalog. The activity does not simulate identifying a real fossil from a bone fragment.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
<div role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);flex:1 1 240px">Site #3 | bones found: 3/10 | cells dug: 7/24 | next clue at 4 bones</div>
<button type="button" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:40px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">New dig</button>
</div>
<div class="dinolab-dig-workspace" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:18px;align-items:start">
<section aria-label="Excavation area" style="max-width:420px">
<div role="group" aria-label="Dig grid with 4 rows and 6 columns. Revealed cells stay focusable so bone and rock results can be reviewed." aria-describedby="dino-dig-keyboard" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6, minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px">
<button id="dino-dig-cell-0" type="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Cell 1, row 1, column 1, bone fragment uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.55);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">🦴</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-1" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 2, row 1, column 2, empty rock uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(120,113,108,0.30);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">·</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-2" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 3, row 1, column 3, empty rock uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(120,113,108,0.30);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">·</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-3" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 4, row 1, column 4, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-4" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 5, row 1, column 5, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-5" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 6, row 1, column 6, empty rock uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(120,113,108,0.30);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">·</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-6" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 7, row 2, column 1, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-7" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 8, row 2, column 2, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-8" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 9, row 2, column 3, bone fragment uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.55);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">🦴</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-9" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 10, row 2, column 4, bone fragment uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.55);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">🦴</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-10" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 11, row 2, column 5, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-11" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 12, row 2, column 6, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-12" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 13, row 3, column 1, empty rock uncovered." aria-disabled="true" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:rgba(120,113,108,0.30);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">·</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-13" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 14, row 3, column 2, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-14" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 15, row 3, column 3, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-15" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 16, row 3, column 4, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-16" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 17, row 3, column 5, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-17" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 18, row 3, column 6, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-18" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 19, row 4, column 1, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-19" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 20, row 4, column 2, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-20" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 21, row 4, column 3, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-21" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 22, row 4, column 4, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-22" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 23, row 4, column 5, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
<button id="dino-dig-cell-23" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Cell 24, row 4, column 6, unopened rock. Press to dig." aria-disabled="false" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1;min-height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:#7c5e3b;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
</button>
</div>
<p id="dino-dig-keyboard" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);line-height:1.6">Use arrow keys to move between cells; Enter or Space digs. Bone and empty-rock results remain available to review.</p>
<button type="button" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:40px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">Use a prepared sample</button>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);line-height:1.6">Prefer to focus on the evidence? A prepared sample opens the clues so you can begin comparing.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="dino-dig-clues-title" style="border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;background:var(--allo-stem-panel, #1e293b)">
<h2 id="dino-dig-clues-title" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px">1. Collect and cite clues</h2>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">Select at least two uncovered clues to support your identification. Useful evidence must also distinguish your candidate from the alternatives.</p>
<div style="display:grid;gap:8px">
<label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">
<input type="checkbox" data-dig-clue="period" style="width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0;accent-color:#15803d"/>Time: Cretaceous · Late Cretaceous</label>
<label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">
<input type="checkbox" data-dig-clue="diet" style="width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0;accent-color:#15803d"/>Diet: Herbivore</label>
<label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);border-radius:8px;background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">
<input type="checkbox" data-dig-clue="group" style="width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0;accent-color:#15803d"/>Group: Ornithischian</label>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<section aria-labelledby="dino-dig-candidates-title" style="margin-top:20px">
<h2 id="dino-dig-candidates-title" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px">2. Compare the candidates</h2>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">These are catalog reference values. Compare each one with the clues you have uncovered; several candidates may fit early evidence.</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Identify the find choices" class="dinolab-dig-candidates" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px">
<article data-dig-candidate="sinornithosaurus" style="min-width:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;border:2px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-panel, #1e293b)">
<button type="button" aria-label="Choose candidate: Sinornithosaurus" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:8px">○ Sinornithosaurus</button>
<dl style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6">
<div style="margin-bottom:5px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">Time</dt>
<dd style="margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Cretaceous · Early Cretaceous</dd>
</div>
<div style="margin-bottom:5px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">Diet</dt>
<dd style="margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Carnivore</dd>
</div>
<div style="margin-bottom:5px">
<dt style="font-weight:800;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8)">Group</dt>
<dd style="margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Theropod</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</article>
<article data-dig-candidate="kosmoceratops" style="min-width:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;border:2px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-panel, #1e293b)">
<button type="button" aria-label="Choose candidate: Kosmoceratops" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" style="padding:9px 12px;min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);background:var(--allo-stem-deeper, #0b1220);color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:8px">○ Kosmoceratops</button>
<dl style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6">
<div style="margin-bottom:5px">
