</nav>
<div id="dinopanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="dinotab-extinction" style="padding:16px">
<div>
<section class="dinolab-kpg" aria-labelledby="dino-kpg-heading" data-kpg-step="0">
<header class="dinolab-kpg-header">
<div>
<p class="dinolab-kpg-kicker">CASE FILE / 66 MILLION YEARS AGO</p>
<h2 id="dino-kpg-heading">One impact. A world of consequences.</h2>
<p>How could an impact in one place disrupt life across the planet? Follow the evidence from rocks to an explanation.</p>
</div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 180 130" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="dinolab-kpg-art">
<g>
<path d="M20 106Q88 75 165 106M104 28L131 56M90 26L116 52M116 16L143 44" fill="none" stroke="var(--dino-accent)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
</path>
<circle cx="140" cy="65" r="17" fill="var(--dino-fossil)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
</circle>
<path d="M126 88L119 104M152 88L162 101" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
</path>
</g>
</svg>
</header>
<div class="dinolab-kpg-steps" role="group" aria-label="Extinction investigation steps">
<button type="button" aria-current="step">1 · Inspect the sources</button>
<button type="button">2 · Connect the effects</button>
<button type="button">3 · Explain and revise</button>
</div>
<div class="dinolab-kpg-task">
<div>
<h3 id="dino-kpg-task" tabindex="-1">Different sources answer different questions</h3>
<p>Rock evidence helps test whether an impact occurred. Models help test its consequences. Read both before explaining how a local event could have global effects.</p>
<div class="dinolab-kpg-sources">
<div class="dinolab-kpg-picker" role="group" aria-label="Choose an extinction source">
