<div style="color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.3">Seasonal floodplain / open woodland</div>
<div style="color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:2px">Hell Creek Formation / North America</div>
