<div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:8px">Evidence path 0/2 linked: Skull -&gt; Shoulder -&gt; Hip</div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--allo-stem-text, #f1f5f9);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6px">Target: Skull anchor</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8);line-height:1.48;margin-bottom:8px">Check how skull evidence constrains head size, bite posture, and sensory placement.</div>
